{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人楊茜堯與陳豪今日（1日）出席新劇《玫瑰戰爭》「久別重逢 暗藏殺機」宣傳活動，劇中陳豪飾演娛樂公司老闆「陳雲生」，他笑指被多位女明星圍繞心情「比較興奮」：「呢個又要女主角，個個又要，你錫我多啲啊，咁畀你做啦！</p><p>」楊茜堯隨即笑稱他被眾女星圍住</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:49.617251+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T08:15:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771600+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771600+00:00","content_hash":"d1147554293b9c5019b2ae852ff2b3d48f8dcefb7f5f2eecda3d6d2e16889773","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}